% PowerPoint slides 7–10.
### Flat and Folded WAT
[v0] @(70, 170) {$code, w=740px, size=23px} ```
(module
  (func $Fun1
    (param $var0 f64) (param $var1 f64)
    (result f64)
    (f64.mul (local.get $var0) (local.get $var0))
    local.get $var1
    local.get $var1
    f64.mul
  )
  (export "CalcHypotenuse" (func $Fun1))
)
```
[explain] @(850, 195) {$note, w=345px, size=27px, color=explain} Fold the first multiplication around its two operands.
...
!anim v0 hide 0.15s
!anim explain text Fold the second multiplication in the same way.
[v1] @(70, 170) {$code, w=740px, size=23px} ```
(module
  (func $Fun1
    (param $var0 f64) (param $var1 f64)
    (result f64)
    (f64.mul (local.get $var0) (local.get $var0))
    (f64.mul (local.get $var1) (local.get $var1))
  )
  (export "CalcHypotenuse" (func $Fun1))
)
```
...
!anim v1 hide 0.15s
!anim explain text Add the two squared values.
[v2] @(70, 170) {$code, w=740px, size=23px} ```
(module
  (func $Fun1
    (param $var0 f64) (param $var1 f64)
    (result f64)
    (f64.mul (local.get $var0) (local.get $var0))
    (f64.mul (local.get $var1) (local.get $var1))
    f64.add
  )
  (export "CalcHypotenuse" (func $Fun1))
)
```
...
!anim v2 hide 0.15s
!anim explain text Take the square root to obtain the hypotenuse.
[v3] @(70, 170) {$code, w=740px, size=23px} ```
(module
  (func $Fun1
    (param $var0 f64) (param $var1 f64)
    (result f64)
    (f64.mul (local.get $var0) (local.get $var0))
    (f64.mul (local.get $var1) (local.get $var1))
    f64.add
    f64.sqrt
  )
  (export "CalcHypotenuse" (func $Fun1))
)
```
[formula] @(850, 455) {$note, w=345px, size=40px, color=emp} √(a² + b²)
{color=emp} !line (0.684, 0.635) (0.795, 0.635)
...
!anim v3 hide 0.15s
!anim explain text Nest the addition inside the square root. The evaluation order is unchanged.
[v4] @(70, 170) {$code, w=740px, size=22px} ```
(module
  (func $Fun1
    (param $var0 f64) (param $var1 f64)
    (result f64)
    (f64.sqrt
      (f64.add
        (f64.mul (local.get $var0) (local.get $var0))
        (f64.mul (local.get $var1) (local.get $var1))
      )
    )
  )
  (export "CalcHypotenuse" (func $Fun1))
)
```
