### Parsing a Function Signature
[source] @(70, 135) {$code, w=1140px, size=23px} ```
function CalcHypotenuse(double sideA, double sideB) : double {
  double c_sqr = sideA * sideA + sideB * sideB;
  return sqrt(c_sqr);
}
```
[grammar] @(70, 310) {$code, w=755px, size=23px} ```
FUNCTION → 'function' ID '(' PARAMS ')'
           ':' TYPE '{' BLOCK '}'
```
[symtitle] @(865, 310) {$note, w=330px, size=28px, color=emp} **Symbol Table**
[explain] @(70, 595) {$note, w=755px, size=26px, color=explain} Recognize the function keyword.
[cursor] {color=focus, thick=3, fill=none, round=0} !rect (82,146) (114,33)
...
!anim cursor hide 0s
[cursor1] {color=focus, thick=3, fill=none, round=0} !rect (207,146) (195,33)
!anim explain text Record the function name.
[symfun] @(865, 362) {$note, w=330px, size=23px} {{color=id|CalcHypotenuse}} : {{color=focus|function}}
...
!anim cursor1 hide 0s
[cursor2] {color=focus, thick=3, fill=none, round=0} !rect (402,146) (14,33)
!anim explain text Consume '(', then parse the parameter list.
[params] @(70, 420) {$code, w=755px, size=23px} ```
PARAMS → ε | TYPE ID EXTRA_PS
EXTRA_PS → ε | ',' TYPE ID EXTRA_PS
```
...
!anim cursor2 hide 0s
[cursor3] {color=focus, thick=3, fill=none, round=0} !rect (416,146) (167,33)
[symA] @(865, 465) {$note, w=330px, size=23px} {{color=id|sideA}} : {{color=focus|double}} (id: 0)
!anim explain text Allocate symbol 0 for sideA.
...
[symparams] @(885, 395) {$note, w=330px, size=23px} params: 0
!anim explain text Add parameter 0 to the function’s ordered parameter list.
...
!anim cursor3 hide 0s
[cursor4] {color=focus, thick=3, fill=none, round=0} !rect (582,146) (28,33)
!anim explain text The comma selects another TYPE ID pair.
...
!anim cursor4 hide 0s
[cursor5] {color=focus, thick=3, fill=none, round=0} !rect (610,146) (167,33)
[symB] @(865, 502) {$note, w=330px, size=23px} {{color=id|sideB}} : {{color=focus|double}} (id: 1)
!anim symparams text params: 0, 1
!anim explain text Allocate symbol 1 for sideB and append it to the parameter list.
...
!anim cursor5 hide 0s
[cursor6] {color=focus, thick=3, fill=none, round=0} !rect (776,146) (42,33)
!anim params hide 0.15s
!anim explain text End the parameter list with ε. Consume ')' and ':'.
...
!anim cursor6 hide 0s
[cursor7] {color=focus, thick=3, fill=none, round=0} !rect (825,146) (95,33)
[symret] @(885, 425) {$note, w=330px, size=23px} return type: {{color=focus|double}}
!anim explain text Record double as the return type.
...
!anim cursor7 hide 0s
[cursor8] {color=focus, thick=3, fill=none, round=0} !rect (925,146) (20,33)
!anim explain text Consume '{' and begin parsing the function body.
