### Structure of a Compiler
[stage0] {$node, size=25px, fill=#612245} !rect (440,146) (420,44) Source Language
[stage1] {$node, size=25px, fill=#173749} !rect (440,210) (420,44) Lexical Analyzer
[link1] {$edge} !arrow (650,190) (650,210)
[stage2] {$node, size=25px, fill=#173749} !rect (440,266) (420,44) Syntax Analyzer
[link2] {$edge} !arrow (650,254) (650,266)
[stage3] {$node, size=25px, fill=#173749} !rect (440,322) (420,44) Semantic Analyzer
[link3] {$edge} !arrow (650,310) (650,322)
[stage4] {$node, size=25px, fill=#173749} !rect (440,378) (420,44) Int. Code Generator
[link4] {$edge} !arrow (650,366) (650,378)
[stage5] {$node, size=25px, fill=#654614} !rect (440,448) (420,44) Intermediate Code
[link5] {$edge} !arrow (650,422) (650,448)
[stage6] {$node, size=25px, fill=#173749} !rect (440,518) (420,44) Code Optimizer
[link6] {$edge} !arrow (650,492) (650,518)
[stage7] {$node, size=25px, fill=#173749} !rect (440,574) (420,44) Target Code Generator
[link7] {$edge} !arrow (650,562) (650,574)
[stage8] {$node, size=25px, fill=#1B5439} !rect (440,644) (420,44) Target Language
[link8] {$edge} !arrow (650,618) (650,644)
